{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd88\ud83e\udd88  THE FIN-TASTIC SALVAGE COMPANY UPDATE\ud83e\udd88\ud83e\udd88</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect hidden treasures and send them up for a reward: will you work together, or make it every shark for themselves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 You're a shark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Hang out with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Proximity voice chat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Public and Private lobbies/rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 100's of cosmetics to express your true shark </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 <strong>You're a shark</strong>: use your mouth to bite, grab, carry, place, build and attack in this multiplayer physics sandbox game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/Stickybomb03.gif?t=1751951340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Swim around</strong> to collect hidden treasures and send them up to the FIN-TASTIC SALVAGE COMPANY for a reward: will you work together, or make it every shark for themselves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0000aeecf027b87ac456ec5922c51d01.poster.avif?t=1751951340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0000aeecf027b87ac456ec5922c51d01.webm?t=1751951340\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0000aeecf027b87ac456ec5922c51d01.mp4?t=1751951340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Unique third-person VR locomotion system</strong> that only needs your head and one controller, plus you can play sitting, standing or room-scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/Zombies_Animated.gif?t=1751951340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Do everything with your mouth</strong> (you're a shark so you don't have hands): grab, carry, fling, place, build, open, activate, attack and (of course) eat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0ccb978ae4f916627c801aa970f90417.poster.avif?t=1751951340\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0ccb978ae4f916627c801aa970f90417.webm?t=1751951340\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/0ccb978ae4f916627c801aa970f90417.mp4?t=1751951340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Play with your non-VR friends</strong> on the flat-screen version. Each game is a quick snack-sized round so it's perfect to just drop-in or -out whenever you've got a spare minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/SharksTyres.gif?t=1751951340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Visit the Shark Shop</strong>, with a rotating inventory of items to unlock and wear to express your true shark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/ZombieOutfits.gif?t=1751951340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 <strong>Sharks is Early Access</strong> which me